 ected official attends and lays a wreath\; a respectful occasion to be see
 n in the community.\n\nDETAILS:\nOrganizer: Royal Canadian Legion Kelowna 
 Branch #26\nWho attends: Veterans\, Canadian Armed Forces\, RCMP\, cadets\
 , Mayor and council\, MPs and MLAs laying wreaths\, thousands of residents
 \nCost: Free\nAccess: Open to the public\; arrive early\, crowds are large
