 ted\, Business Leaders\, Health Care\, Tourism\, Networking Opportunity\n\
 nABOUT:\nBilled as Kelowna's top charitable event\; more than 350 guests a
 nd usually sells out. Proceeds go to Okanagan College's Centre for Food\, 
 Wine and Tourism and Kelowna General Hospital (including JoeAnna's House).
  A VIP 'Elevated Prelude' runs before the gala. Business and civic leaders
  attend. Tickets on Eventbrite.\n\nWHY IT MATTERS (GOVERNMENT RELATIONS):\
 nOne of Kelowna's highest-profile charity evenings\; good for meeting dono
 rs and business leaders who sit on local boards.\n\nDETAILS:\nOrganizer: H
 otel Eldorado\nWho attends: 350+ guests: business owners\, hospitality and
  civic leaders\nAccess: Ticketed\; usually sells out (listed as almost ful
