 uncil
DESCRIPTION:WHEN: Tuesday\, November 17\, 2026\, 4:00 p.m. to 7:00 p.m. (Ke
 lowna time)\nWHERE: Council Chamber\, Kelowna City Hall\, 1435 Water Stree
 t\, Kelowna\, BC\n\nCATEGORY: Municipal Government\nTYPE: Public Hearing\n
