 & Development\, Land Use & Zoning\, GR Must-Attend\n\nABOUT:\nThe new coun
 cil's first Tuesday public hearing and regular meeting on development and 
 zoning applications. The City's council guide lists Tuesday hearings at 4 
 p.m.\; confirm on the agenda at kelowna.ca/council.\n\nWHY IT MATTERS (GOV
 ERNMENT RELATIONS):\nThe clearest window into how the new council votes on
  housing and development\; watch who speaks on behalf of the development i
 ndustry.\n\nDETAILS:\nOrganizer: City of Kelowna\nWho attends: Mayor and c
 ouncil\, planning staff\, applicants\, developers\, neighbours speaking fo
 r or against applications\nCost: Free\nAccess: Open to the public\; member
